Port 2222
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
Protocol 2

HostKey /keys/ssh_host_rsa_key
HostKeyAlgorithms rsa-sha2-512,rsa-sha2-256,ssh-rsa
PubkeyAcceptedAlgorithms rsa-sha2-512,rsa-sha2-256,ssh-rsa
KexAlgorithms curve25519-sha256,diffie-hellman-group14-sha256,diffie-hellman-group14-sha1,diffie-hellman-group-exchange-sha1
Ciphers aes128-ctr,aes192-ctr,aes256-ctr,aes128-cbc
MACs hmac-sha2-256,hmac-sha1

PasswordAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
UsePAM no
PermitRootLogin no
AllowUsers relay

AllowTcpForwarding yes
GatewayPorts no
PermitOpen 127.0.0.1:15900 127.0.0.1:10022 127.0.0.1:18080 127.0.0.1:18443
PermitListen 127.0.0.1:15900 127.0.0.1:10022 127.0.0.1:18080 127.0.0.1:18443
AllowAgentForwarding no
AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
X11Forwarding no
PermitTunnel no
PermitTTY no

ClientAliveInterval 30
ClientAliveCountMax 3
LoginGraceTime 30
MaxAuthTries 3
MaxSessions 4
TCPKeepAlive yes

PidFile /run/sshd/sshd.pid
AuthorizedKeysFile /keys/authorized_keys
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
